02:18.610 --> 02:25.590
<b>The Constant Problem of Prioritizing</b>

02:43.950 --> 02:46.510
<b>Good morning!</b>

02:46.520 --> 02:48.350
<b>Good work, everyone!</b>

02:58.360 --> 03:01.860
<b>39 Cable TV, Sukawara here!</b>

03:01.860 --> 03:05.770
<b>“Su-ka-wa-ra. Be careful not to misread it,” right?</b>

03:05.770 --> 03:08.540
<b>Oh! Don’t say it before I do!</b>

03:08.540 --> 03:10.170
<b>It’s finally two days away, huh?</b>

03:10.170 --> 03:12.340
<b>I’ll be looking forward to covering this
festival with everyone again this year.</b>

03:12.340 --> 03:15.040
<b>A little higher!</b>

03:13.010 --> 03:15.040
<b>We’ll be looking forward to working with you, too.</b>

03:15.040 --> 03:20.520
<b>Cat</b>

03:15.040 --> 03:20.520
<b>Dance</b>

03:15.040 --> 03:20.520
<b>The</b>

03:15.040 --> 03:17.910
<b>A little more to the left!</b>

03:15.040 --> 03:17.910
<b>We have to expand this festival...</b>

03:17.910 --> 03:20.510
<b>...past the prefecture to the rest of the nation, right?</b>

03:20.520 --> 03:23.550
<b>And we’ll need the media’s help to do that.</b>

03:23.550 --> 03:27.920
<b>I’m just from a no-name TV station,
but I’ll be sure to do the best I can!</b>

03:35.830 --> 03:37.670
<b>Is your store all right?</b>

03:38.200 --> 03:40.300
<b>I decided to take the morning off.</b>

03:40.300 --> 03:42.470
<b>You’re really getting into the spirit of things, huh?</b>

03:42.470 --> 03:44.140
<b>There aren’t enough people, so I don’t have a choice.</b>

03:44.840 --> 03:45.610
<b>Where?</b>

03:46.440 --> 03:47.840
<b>Both places.</b>

