<b>Tana Neighborhood Council</b>

03:56.720 --> 03:57.890
<b>What brings you here today?</b>

03:57.890 --> 04:00.450
<b>A preliminary survey of the big event.</b>

04:00.460 --> 04:01.590
<b>Two days early?</b>

04:02.090 --> 04:03.690
<b>I’m all fired up!</b>

04:03.690 --> 04:05.790
<b>After all, there’s a lot going on this summer.</b>

04:07.900 --> 04:09.900
<b>Speaking of which, how have things been going?</b>

04:09.900 --> 04:11.100
<b>Anything unusual happening?</b>

04:11.830 --> 04:14.570
<b>These next two or three days
will be pretty calm, I imagine.</b>

04:14.570 --> 04:15.470
<b>Sukawara-san...</b>

04:15.470 --> 04:16.940
<b>Yes?</b>

04:17.510 --> 04:19.310
<b>If you don’t mind,
would you like to help out?</b>

04:19.310 --> 04:22.640
<b>You can talk and move your hands
at the same time, right?</b>

04:26.420 --> 04:29.250
<b>Did you hear when Mika-nee will be coming back?</b>

04:29.250 --> 04:31.520
<b>She said sometime in the afternoon
the day after tomorrow.</b>

04:31.520 --> 04:32.850
<b>Coming back the same day, huh?</b>

04:32.850 --> 04:33.550
<b>Yeah.</b>

04:34.920 --> 04:36.660
<b>I don’t get her.</b>

04:36.660 --> 04:39.860
<b>I’m sure Mika-nee has a lot of
things to take care of, too.</b>

04:39.860 --> 04:40.560
<b>“Too”?</b>

04:40.560 --> 04:43.000
<b>Don’t you have a lot to do, Miku?</b>

04:44.500 --> 04:47.940
<b>If you mean living each day, then I guess so.</b>

04:47.940 --> 04:50.570
<b>Sometimes I wonder how old you really are.</b>

04:50.570 --> 04:52.540
<b>Miki, can you take care of the deliveries?</b>

04:54.510 --> 04:55.740
<b>Sure.</b>

04:55.740 --> 04:59.010
<b>I need to go to the site to help out
with the festival’s construction.</b>

04:59.010 --> 04:59.710
<b>Sorry about this.</b>

04:59.720 --> 05:02.820
<b>Gotcha. Who’s getting what today?</b>

05:08.290 --> 05:10.690
<b>Isn’t the seam a little too high?</b>

05:13.700 --> 05:15.260
<b>She must be a little confused.</b>

05:31.450 --> 05:32.810
<b>I can’t do it!</b>

05:37.790 --> 05:40.790
<b>“If I were a bird...”</b>

05:40.790 --> 05:44.230
<b>“I could fly in the sky.”</b>

05:44.230 --> 05:49.430
<b>If I were a bird, I could fly in the sky.</b>

05:49.970 --> 05:52.370
<b>Everyone, let’s think about this statement.</b>

05:52.370 --> 05:55.470
<b>If you all were birds...</b>

05:55.470 --> 05:57.170
<b>If you all had wings...</b>

05:56.700 --> 05:58.200
<b>Would you like to go to the Cat Dance?</b>

05:56.700 --> 06:07.220
<b>Create Text</b>

05:57.170 --> 05:59.070
<b>...you could fly in the sky.</b>

05:58.200 --> 05:58.700
<b>Would you like to go to the Cat Dance?</b>

05:58.700 --> 05:59.340
<b>Would you like to go to the Cat Dance?</b>

05:59.070 --> 06:01.510
<b>Don’t you all often think that?</b>

