<b>Wait!</b>

06:44.720 --> 06:48.560
<b>You know... the Cat Dance is the day after tomorrow, right?</b>

06:48.560 --> 06:51.390
<b>Since you came here during our festival season...</b>

06:51.390 --> 06:52.690
<b>...stop by and have a look.</b>

06:53.200 --> 06:55.600
<b>Stop by, okay?</b>

06:55.600 --> 06:56.530
<b>I’ll be waiting for you.</b>

07:06.210 --> 07:07.940
<b>Someone stop by just now?</b>

07:08.580 --> 07:10.540
<b>Yeah, I guess.</b>

07:10.550 --> 07:11.810
<b>I see.</b>

07:11.810 --> 07:12.910
<b>There’s a phone call for you.</b>

07:13.810 --> 07:15.110
<b>Right now?</b>

07:15.110 --> 07:17.180
<b>Yeah. It’s Unno-san.</b>

07:18.210 --> 07:20.350
<b>No pretending to be out.</b>

07:28.420 --> 07:29.060
