07:29.060 --> 07:31.030
<b>You’re slow!</b>

07:32.030 --> 07:34.560
<b>I thought I’d give you a call.</b>

07:34.560 --> 07:36.000
<b>Do you mind?</b>

07:36.530 --> 07:37.470
<b>Yes.</b>

07:37.470 --> 07:41.200
<b>You easily say some blunt things, huh?</b>

07:41.200 --> 07:43.370
<b>That’s not necessarily a bad thing, I guess.</b>

07:43.370 --> 07:44.810
<b>I don’t understand you.</b>

07:45.710 --> 07:48.310
<b>This is about the other day, but...</b>

07:48.980 --> 07:51.710
<b>What? I can’t hear you too well.</b>

07:53.320 --> 07:55.250
<b>About the other day...</b>

07:55.250 --> 07:57.280
