08:36.470 --> 08:39.500
<b>Huh? Sorry, I couldn’t hear you just now.</b>

08:42.000 --> 08:43.840
<b>Ayumu...</b>

08:43.840 --> 08:45.470
<b>...is there someone you like?</b>

08:47.210 --> 08:49.840
<b>If there were, you’d understand how I feel.</b>

08:49.850 --> 08:51.010
<b>Understand what?</b>

08:51.010 --> 08:53.410
<b>The feelings I have for inviting you.</b>

08:54.420 --> 08:56.720
<b>It depends on the person...</b>

08:56.720 --> 08:57.950
<b>...so I might not.</b>

08:57.950 --> 09:01.190
<b>I see. It depends on the person, huh?</b>

09:01.190 --> 09:02.790
<b>Ah, the bus just came.</b>

09:02.790 --> 09:04.630
<b>Is it okay if I call you again later?</b>

09:04.630 --> 09:05.960
<b>Sorry! Talk to you later!</b>

09:10.370 --> 09:11.430
<b>What’s up with her?</b>

09:50.240 --> 09:51.810
<b>Amu, look!</b>

09:51.810 --> 09:53.710
<b>You sure made that well.</b>

09:57.450 --> 09:58.450
<b>Tomorrow...</b>

09:58.450 --> 09:59.250
<b>What’s tomorrow?</b>

09:59.250 --> 10:00.980
<b>The Cat Dance.</b>

10:00.980 --> 10:01.850
<b>That’s the day after tomorrow.</b>

10:03.850 --> 10:05.390
<b>What should we play then?</b>

10:06.660 --> 10:09.060
<b>You can’t... keep your promise?</b>

10:10.230 --> 10:11.830
<b>I can.</b>

10:17.100 --> 10:19.470
<b>You made... another promise.</b>

10:20.700 --> 10:22.170
<b>I haven’t...</b>

10:24.770 --> 10:27.440
<b>Why...? Why are you saying that?</b>

10:28.510 --> 10:30.680
<b>I don’t want to be alone...</b>

10:30.680 --> 10:32.210
<b>You’re not alone.</b>

10:32.210 --> 10:34.750
<b>And I promised to play with you, too.</b>

10:34.750 --> 10:36.880
<b>We made a promise before!</b>

10:36.890 --> 10:38.420
<b>And you didn’t come then, Amu!</b>

10:40.420 --> 10:41.620
<b>I’m sorry.</b>

10:41.620 --> 10:44.360
<b>I don’t really understand much about that one...</b>

10:44.360 --> 10:45.690
<b>I don’t remember it.</b>

10:49.300 --> 10:52.270
<b>Wakkun, those clothes... why?</b>

10:54.800 --> 10:56.140
<b>So I can match you.</b>

10:56.970 --> 10:58.040
<b>So you can match me...?</b>

10:58.040 --> 10:59.240
<b>We match!</b>

11:02.040 --> 11:04.180
<b>That... was you.</b>

11:05.050 --> 11:06.980
<b>I was waiting for you.</b>

11:08.450 --> 11:11.750
<b>I know. Let’s play <i>there</i> again.</b>

11:11.750 --> 11:13.150
<b>“There”?</b>

11:13.160 --> 11:14.460
<b>The Touya Forest?</b>

11:14.460 --> 11:17.160
<b>Yeah! Where I first met you!</b>

11:52.960 --> 11:54.060
<b>Up we go!</b>

11:55.330 --> 11:56.660
<b>Here we go.</b>

12:09.170 --> 12:11.310
<b>Takuma! Help out some.</b>

12:11.310 --> 12:13.150
<b>We don’t have enough hands here.</b>

12:16.720 --> 12:19.620
<b>Ah, you’re preparing the sacred wine altar?</b>

12:20.220 --> 12:22.490
<b>You’re making an altar area
for the sacred wine, right?</b>

12:22.490 --> 12:24.060
<b>The place where you give sacred
wine offerings to God.</b>

12:24.060 --> 12:25.060
<b>Is that what you call it?</b>

12:25.590 --> 12:27.060
<b>I can help out for a bit.</b>

12:27.060 --> 12:30.500
<b>Ah, as expected from the son of the Kaburaki family!</b>

12:42.610 --> 12:43.340
<b>So you’re in here?</b>

12:43.350 --> 12:45.350
<b>Yeah. It’s raining, after all.</b>

12:47.420 --> 12:49.050
<b>You sure not doing exams today is okay?</b>

12:49.050 --> 12:50.280
<b>It’s raining, after all.</b>

12:50.290 --> 12:52.790
<b>And the festival’s tomorrow, too.</b>

12:52.790 --> 12:54.260
<b>I have some time to myself today.</b>

12:55.220 --> 12:57.590
<b>I wonder if the rain will stop anytime soon...</b>

12:57.590 --> 13:00.230
<b>The forecast did mention something
about it letting up...</b>

13:01.300 --> 13:03.330
<b>Did you have a previous engagement with someone?</b>

13:05.830 --> 13:07.170
<b>Yeah...</b>

13:12.540 --> 13:14.110
<b>You weren’t out for a stroll, were you?</b>

13:15.480 --> 13:19.080
<b>I was just wondering where you
were going in this weather.</b>

13:20.180 --> 13:21.480
<b>Just out doing things.</b>

13:21.480 --> 13:24.450
<b>What are you going to do at tomorrow’s festival, Ryousuke?</b>

13:24.450 --> 13:26.290
<b>I don’t really have anyone to invite...</b>

13:26.290 --> 13:28.560
<b>...so I guess I’ll help out at the street stalls again.</b>

13:28.560 --> 13:30.930
<b>You just don’t learn, do you?</b>

13:30.930 --> 13:32.590
<b>Last year, you got caught messing around...</b>

13:32.590 --> 13:34.900
<b>...and started coming to the dojo less afterwards.</b>

13:34.900 --> 13:37.360
<b>That was then, this is now.</b>

13:37.370 --> 13:39.100
<b>I feel like that’s the sort of thing I’m meant to do.</b>

13:39.100 --> 13:40.270
<b>It really suits me.</b>

13:40.270 --> 13:43.840
<b>Working in those stalls is tons of fun.</b>

13:43.840 --> 13:45.370
<b>I just don’t know how you can say that.</b>

13:46.010 --> 13:47.240
<b>Don’t you know why?</b>

13:47.240 --> 13:52.150
<b>You know how there are always items people
really want in the shooting range, right?</b>

13:52.150 --> 13:54.920
<b>But those are just for show to pull the customers in.</b>

13:54.920 --> 13:58.350
<b>They’re really set up so they won’t fall over,
fixed to the platform behind them.</b>

13:58.350 --> 13:59.850
<b>Sounds plausible.</b>

13:59.860 --> 14:02.420
<b>And now about the poi you use
when goldfish scooping?</b>

14:02.420 --> 14:03.620
<b>“Poi”?</b>

14:03.630 --> 14:06.530
<b>So that’s the name of that tool
you use to scoop them...</b>

14:06.530 --> 14:07.500
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:07.500 --> 14:11.030
<b>Goldfish hop out of the water with a “poi!” sound, so that’s where the name came from.</b>

14:11.030 --> 14:13.330
<b>See, there’s a range of different versions...</b>

14:13.340 --> 14:15.240
<b>...from the thin #7 which can
only scoop up one or two...</b>

14:15.240 --> 14:17.610
<b>...to the thick #5 which can easily scoop up ten.</b>

14:17.610 --> 14:19.070
<b>There’s more than just numbers.</b>

14:19.070 --> 14:22.780
<b>There’s also how easily the poi material will break.</b>

14:24.050 --> 14:26.780
<b>That must be pretty troublesome for
the goldfish that get scooped up.</b>

14:26.780 --> 14:28.980
<b>That’s not the point here!</b>

14:28.980 --> 14:30.080
<b>How about this, Takuma?</b>

14:30.090 --> 14:32.990
<b>Do you know the best way
to scoop up fish?</b>

14:32.990 --> 14:35.760
<b>If you do it steadily and carefully, you won’t mess up.</b>

14:35.760 --> 14:39.230
<b>There’s an even easier method than that.</b>

14:39.830 --> 14:41.160
<b>Wanna know what it is?</b>

14:41.160 --> 14:42.430
<b>I’ll tell you.</b>

14:42.430 --> 14:46.330
<b>It’s actually best to lick the opposite side
of the poi before trying to catch with it.</b>

14:46.330 --> 14:47.970
<b>I don’t think I’ll be doing that.</b>

14:47.970 --> 14:51.210
<b>I just can’t see myself wanting
to try something like that.</b>

14:51.210 --> 14:54.740
<b>Talking to you really gets annoying at times!</b>

14:54.740 --> 14:58.110
<b>The rain’s slowed to a drizzle,
so let’s hurry and finish things up.</b>

15:17.600 --> 15:19.170
<b>Welcome!</b>

15:22.200 --> 15:26.310
<b>You have an umbrella,
so why are you so wet?</b>

15:26.310 --> 15:29.340
<b>Ah... well, putting that aside...</b>

15:29.340 --> 15:31.050
<b>...I was thinking of inviting you...</b>

15:33.120 --> 15:37.120
<b>You’re going to enter the Cat Dance performance with your two sisters, right?</b>

15:37.120 --> 15:37.990
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:38.520 --> 15:40.250
<b>After that would be fine.</b>

15:40.260 --> 15:41.720
<b>Want to...</b>

15:41.720 --> 15:42.960
<b>...walk about the festival together?</b>

15:44.460 --> 15:45.530
<b>No?</b>

15:46.430 --> 15:48.230
<b>You have Unno.</b>

15:48.230 --> 15:51.130
<b>Geez... you need to treat her better.</b>

15:51.130 --> 15:53.230
<b>I’m inviting you.</b>

15:54.240 --> 15:55.440
<b>Umm...</b>

15:59.410 --> 16:01.280
<b>Am I no good?</b>

16:01.280 --> 16:03.510
<b>That’s not it...</b>

16:03.510 --> 16:05.780
<b>Do you have... something else to do?</b>

16:06.200 --> 16:07.380
<b>No...</b>

16:21.860 --> 16:24.870
<b>Did you promise to go with Aizawa instead?</b>

16:24.870 --> 16:27.300
<b>That’s not it either...</b>

16:28.740 --> 16:30.870
<b>Just tell me what it is.</b>

16:30.870 --> 16:31.740
<b>Tell you what?</b>

16:32.340 --> 16:33.570
<b>Miki...</b>

16:35.010 --> 16:36.740
<b>If you’re going to choose Aizawa...</b>

16:36.750 --> 16:39.210
<b>Why does it have to turn out this way?</b>

16:40.250 --> 16:42.580
<b>Choosing... not choosing...</b>

16:42.580 --> 16:46.420
<b>Are these things we have to choose
right now at this point in our lives?</b>

16:46.420 --> 16:49.060
<b>I think the small decisions we make over time...</b>

16:49.060 --> 16:52.630
<b>...end up deciding the path we’ll take in life.</b>

16:52.630 --> 16:53.930
<b>We’re...</b>

16:53.930 --> 16:56.130
<b>...always choosing to do small things during the day...</b>

16:56.130 --> 16:59.430
<b>...and there are some things we must
choose before we can move forward.</b>

17:03.110 --> 17:04.640
<b>Sorry for bothering you.</b>

17:07.980 --> 17:09.640
<b>He’s...</b>

17:09.640 --> 17:11.710
<b>...going to go home soon.</b>

17:13.450 --> 17:15.080
<b>He won’t be here any longer.</b>

17:15.080 --> 17:17.820
<b>If you don’t tell him how you feel, he’ll never get it.</b>

17:28.630 --> 17:30.970
<b><i>I know that...</i></b>

17:30.970 --> 17:32.630
<b><i>I know that, but...</i></b>

17:39.610 --> 17:40.740
<b>Don’t be confused.</b>

18:12.940 --> 18:13.970
<b>Wait.</b>

18:18.450 --> 18:19.480
<b>Good boy.</b>

18:26.150 --> 18:28.260
<b>Once the rain lets up...</b>

18:28.260 --> 18:30.560
<b>...shall we go and see the festival tomorrow?</b>

18:32.790 --> 18:35.160
<b>I’m not too good with large crowds, though.</b>

18:54.040 --> 18:57.250
<b>You sure like this place, huh?</b>

18:58.690 --> 19:01.320
<b>You’ve... never thought of going in, right?</b>

19:01.320 --> 19:02.920
<b>I haven’t, but...</b>

19:02.920 --> 19:06.030
<b>...is going in really that bad of a thing?</b>

19:06.830 --> 19:08.300
<b>It’s taboo.</b>

19:08.300 --> 19:11.070
<b>But more importantly,
it’s someone’s house.</b>

19:11.070 --> 19:14.500
<b>Even if it’s abandoned, entering without
permission isn’t a good thing.</b>

19:26.780 --> 19:30.180
<b>I’d like to ask you again...</b>

19:30.190 --> 19:33.420
<b>What do you think of Miyama?</b>

19:34.160 --> 19:35.820
<b>What do I think of her?</b>

19:35.820 --> 19:37.360
<b>Normal things.</b>

19:37.360 --> 19:40.800
<b>You’re involved. Don’t you get it?</b>

19:40.800 --> 19:41.720
<b>I’m involved?</b>

19:42.760 --> 19:44.100
<b>What I’m trying to say is...</b>

19:48.660 --> 19:51.640
<b>Miyama Miki</b>

19:48.660 --> 19:51.640
<b>Incoming</b>

19:52.970 --> 19:54.310
<b>Why don’t you take the call?</b>

19:58.650 --> 20:02.220
<b>Don’t treat Miyama halfheartedly.</b>

20:05.590 --> 20:06.420
<b>Hello?</b>

20:07.060 --> 20:08.590
<b>Oh, what’s this?</b>

20:08.590 --> 20:11.230
<b>You’re also not feeling well, Aizawa Ayumu?</b>

20:11.230 --> 20:12.260
<b>“Also”?</b>

20:12.260 --> 20:13.490
<b>It’s nothing.</b>

20:13.500 --> 20:15.260
<b>Just talking about something here.</b>

20:15.260 --> 20:17.060
<b>What are you doing tomorrow?</b>

20:18.070 --> 20:20.700
<b>Wakkun said he’d be going to the Touya Forest.</b>

20:20.700 --> 20:21.400
<b>What?</b>

20:21.400 --> 20:24.140
<b>It just seems like the rain won’t stop...</b>

20:24.140 --> 20:26.640
<b>...and tomorrow’s festival
might be cancelled.</b>

20:26.640 --> 20:27.780
<b>That’s all.</b>

20:27.780 --> 20:30.910
<b>And you’ll be able to finish things off
by playing with Wakkun there?</b>

20:30.910 --> 20:31.370
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:32.680 --> 20:33.910
<b>It’ll be fine.</b>

20:33.920 --> 20:34.980
<b>What will be?</b>

20:34.980 --> 20:38.350
<b>I don’t really know myself,
but I know it’ll be fine.</b>

20:38.350 --> 20:40.250
<b>I completely don’t get you as always.</b>

20:40.260 --> 20:41.890
<b>Well then, see you tomorrow.</b>

20:45.730 --> 20:47.060
<b>Thank you.</b>

20:47.060 --> 20:50.660
<b>Are you seeing Aizawa-kun tomorrow?</b>

20:50.670 --> 20:52.300
<b>Nope. Why?</b>

20:52.300 --> 20:54.200
<b>No... no reason.</b>

20:54.970 --> 20:57.140
<b>It’ll be nice if it stops raining.</b>

20:57.140 --> 20:59.170
<b>It will. Definitely.</b>

20:59.170 --> 21:01.140
<b>God</b>

