21:19.860 --> 21:21.700
<b>I took out your yukata.</b>

21:21.700 --> 21:23.560
<b>You’re going to the festival
tomorrow, right?</b>

21:25.070 --> 21:26.370
<b>Or aren’t you?</b>

21:27.470 --> 21:28.440
<b>I don’t know...</b>

21:40.120 --> 21:43.280
<b>I’ll head to the scene of the festival around
one tomorrow afternoon, okay?</b>

21:43.290 --> 21:46.190
<b>That’s fine with me,
but what about the rain?</b>

21:48.090 --> 21:49.790
<b>I’m a bright and sunny woman!</b>

21:49.790 --> 21:50.960
<b>You have no basis for that statement.</b>

21:51.860 --> 21:54.300
<b>And have they made a decision
whether it’ll even still be held?</b>

21:54.300 --> 21:56.930
<b>They said they’d post a message in the
afternoon at town hall if it’s cancelled.</b>

21:58.400 --> 22:01.100
<b>Besides, after raining this much,
it’s bound to let up tomorrow!</b>

22:02.540 --> 22:05.170
<b>“Cloudy with rain,” huh?</b>

22:05.170 --> 22:06.810
<b>Geez! I’ll make it all bright and shiny with my spirit!</b>

22:11.550 --> 22:14.280
<b><i>What can I do...?</i></b>

22:30.200 --> 22:31.700
<b>What are you things?</b>

22:37.270 --> 22:39.640
<b>I’m kind of...</b>

22:39.640 --> 22:41.080
<b>...scared of you.</b>

