24:20.480 --> 24:21.210
<b>It’s so hot!</b>

24:21.210 --> 24:22.040
<b>It’s so hot.</b>

24:22.040 --> 24:22.640
<b>It’s so hot...</b>

24:22.640 --> 24:24.040
<b>It’s too hot!</b>

24:24.040 --> 24:25.280
<b>It’s too hot.</b>

24:25.280 --> 24:26.710
<b>It’s too hot...</b>

24:26.720 --> 24:28.250
<b>Talk about something, will you, Roku?</b>

24:28.250 --> 24:30.120
<b>Talk about something, Taruto-chan.</b>

24:30.120 --> 24:31.550
<b>Talk about something, Grandma...</b>

24:31.550 --> 24:34.790
<b>It’s so hot because Tana’s a valley.</b>

24:34.790 --> 24:36.920
<b>Bonchi (valley)...
Bonchi-age (sweet soy-flavored rice crackers)...</b>

24:36.930 --> 24:38.630
<b>Oh! I’d sure like to eat some of those!</b>

24:38.630 --> 24:41.100
<b>Yeah! Together with some hot tea.</b>

24:41.100 --> 24:43.560
<b>Stop it! Don’t say “hot,” you moron!</b>

24:43.560 --> 24:45.070
<b>This is no good...</b>

24:45.070 --> 24:48.140
<b>I guess I, the young and level-headed
one, will have to take care of things.</b>

24:48.140 --> 24:49.370
<b>Next time will be...!</b>

24:49.370 --> 24:50.840
<b>Next time will be... what was it again?</b>

24:52.040 --> 24:54.810
<b>Next time will be: “Complicated Feelings in the Rain.”</b>

24:54.810 --> 24:58.010
<b>Oh! So some rain will come! I’m so thankful!</b>

24:55.010 --> 24:59.950
<b>Complicated Feelings in the Rain</b>
